WEBVTT

00:00:05.068 --> 00:00:08.947
I wonder where everyone meets
their soulmates.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:13.243
I want a rich, handsome husband too.

00:00:13.326 --> 00:00:16.287
The new season of Last Princess
is streaming!

00:00:16.371 --> 00:00:17.914
All right, let’s watch it! Right now!

00:00:17.997 --> 00:00:20.792
I'm in the mood for romance,
so we are watching this now!

00:00:21.417 --> 00:00:23.211
I'm Kotaro Komiyama.

00:00:23.294 --> 00:00:24.212
Through my hobby,

00:00:24.295 --> 00:00:27.090
I've built up some muscles.
That's my charm.

00:00:27.173 --> 00:00:29.467
This guy seems super shady.

00:00:29.551 --> 00:00:31.219
Total meathead vibes.

00:00:31.302 --> 00:00:32.387
I'm Airi.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:36.266
I'm 27 years old. I work as a model.

00:00:36.349 --> 00:00:37.892
Wow, she's gorgeous!

00:00:37.976 --> 00:00:40.145
She's totally a pro at this romance stuff.

00:00:40.228 --> 00:00:41.563
She's not all that.

00:00:41.646 --> 00:00:43.273
-Wow, you're amazing!
-Not really.

00:00:43.356 --> 00:00:45.149
Saunas are very trendy right now.

00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:47.277
They are, they're super popular.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.863
You're such a sharp businessman
to see opportunity in that!

00:00:49.946 --> 00:00:53.491
There it is!
Those are staple lines of popular girls.

00:00:53.575 --> 00:00:55.034
-"You're amazing!"
-"I didn't know that!"

00:00:55.118 --> 00:00:56.411
-"Wow!"
-"You have great sense!"

00:00:56.494 --> 00:00:57.704
"I see."

00:00:57.787 --> 00:01:00.081
You two are amazing!

00:01:00.165 --> 00:01:02.584
I went and got certified
as a food advisor!

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:05.044
-Really?
-Oh, she has qualifications.

00:01:05.128 --> 00:01:06.588
So she's not like me.

00:01:06.671 --> 00:01:09.090
I like people who are like aliens.

00:01:09.174 --> 00:01:11.176
There it is, the quirky ditz persona.

00:01:11.259 --> 00:01:14.262
When you can't win with a conventional
approach, you have to act weird.

00:01:14.345 --> 00:01:16.639
Girls like her surprisingly
make it far in these shows.

00:01:16.723 --> 00:01:19.642
I want to have a romance
like Last Princess too!

00:01:21.644 --> 00:01:23.396
Who are you?

00:01:23.479 --> 00:01:26.858
Mr. Konta invited us over!

00:01:28.943 --> 00:01:30.236
Isn't this just like…

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:32.280
Our very own reality dating show?

00:01:32.363 --> 00:01:34.282
-I've got to put on makeup.
-What?

00:01:34.365 --> 00:01:36.701
-Me too!
-Huh? Wait… Well…

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:39.662
Please wait just a moment.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:42.582
I have no choice but to win.

00:01:42.665 --> 00:01:44.167
I am confident.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:48.755
I'm betting my 27 years of life,
I will win this.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:52.842
I want to be in a relationship
where we help each other grow.

00:01:52.926 --> 00:01:55.303
And I will find it, no matter what.

00:01:56.262 --> 00:02:02.018
Who will win and be chosen
as the last princess?

00:02:05.813 --> 00:02:07.523
Okay…

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:11.903
Whoa. So much trash.

00:02:23.039 --> 00:02:24.916
-Here.
-Thank you.

00:02:25.792 --> 00:02:30.797
So, you all came here
because my brother invited you?

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:32.340
Yes. Wait, he's your brother?

00:02:32.423 --> 00:02:33.841
Oh, right.

00:02:33.925 --> 00:02:36.511
I'm Midori, Konta's younger sister.

00:02:36.594 --> 00:02:39.055
I'm Rinrin, Midori's friend.

00:02:39.138 --> 00:02:41.224
Likewise, I'm her friend, Tsumugi.

00:02:41.307 --> 00:02:43.685
Sorry, I forgot to introduce myself.
I'm Kotaro.

00:02:43.768 --> 00:02:45.228
They are my friends from college.

00:02:45.311 --> 00:02:46.145
I'm Ryusei.

00:02:46.229 --> 00:02:47.063
I'm Norito.

00:02:47.647 --> 00:02:49.315
We came here from Tokyo.

00:02:49.399 --> 00:02:51.651
We met Mr. Konta by chance
at a roadside station,

00:02:51.734 --> 00:02:54.612
and he said, "We're having a barbecue
at my villa, you should come."

00:02:54.696 --> 00:02:55.738
I see.

00:02:56.489 --> 00:02:58.074
So, where is my brother?

00:02:58.157 --> 00:02:59.826
He's still out buying groceries.

00:02:59.909 --> 00:03:02.662
He said, "There are three ladies
at home, you can go there first."

00:03:04.288 --> 00:03:05.707
Nice, Konta!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.625
He can be useful sometimes.

00:03:09.002 --> 00:03:13.214
You said you all came from Tokyo,
so what do you do for work?

00:03:13.297 --> 00:03:15.591
I work at an IT company.

00:03:15.675 --> 00:03:17.260
I'm a financial planner.

00:03:17.343 --> 00:03:18.845
I run my own company.

00:03:20.805 --> 00:03:22.890
They're handsome and successful!

00:03:22.974 --> 00:03:25.685
Perhaps they are
our matches made in heaven?

00:03:25.768 --> 00:03:27.979
Our inspirational Last Princess?

00:03:28.062 --> 00:03:30.523
Our dating show has finally begun!

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:55.840
That's right.

00:03:55.923 --> 00:03:58.885
I think I've been in more relationships
than the average girl.

00:03:59.594 --> 00:04:03.931
But I think it's about time
I find that one special soulmate.

00:04:04.807 --> 00:04:05.641
My type?

00:04:06.309 --> 00:04:08.269
Let's see…

00:04:08.353 --> 00:04:10.897
I think I like a man who can lead,

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.900
so I can always walk
three steps behind him.

00:04:14.525 --> 00:04:16.903
I'm actually quite traditional.

00:04:18.237 --> 00:04:22.700
RINRIN
#I WILL STOP BEING EVERYONE'S IDOL

00:04:22.784 --> 00:04:26.496
I came here to experience
the passionate love of a lifetime.

00:04:27.997 --> 00:04:29.165
WHAT KIND OF LOVE DO YOU WANT?

00:04:29.248 --> 00:04:30.500
Let's see…

00:04:30.583 --> 00:04:35.588
Whether you're my friend or not,
I don't plan on holding back.

00:04:36.672 --> 00:04:41.719
TSUMUGI
#THE ROMANCE WRECKER WITH NOTHING TO LOSE

00:04:42.303 --> 00:04:44.889
I'm currently unemployed.

00:04:45.556 --> 00:04:49.560
But when it comes to housework
like cooking and cleaning,

00:04:50.269 --> 00:04:52.188
I work harder than anyone!

00:04:52.814 --> 00:04:57.235
MIDORI
#MY NEXT WORKPLACE IS Y-O-U!

00:04:57.819 --> 00:04:59.278
FINALLY, A WORD ON YOUR RESOLVE

00:04:59.362 --> 00:05:00.571
-I will…
-Definitely…

00:05:00.655 --> 00:05:03.908
Find a good person here
and go back to Tokyo with him!

00:05:35.648 --> 00:05:38.484
Well then,
here's to our wonderful meeting.

00:05:39.026 --> 00:05:42.113
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

00:05:46.367 --> 00:05:49.745
Drinking at midday,
on a sunny day like this, is the best.

00:05:49.829 --> 00:05:52.123
It really makes you feel free, doesn't it?

00:05:52.206 --> 00:05:54.083
Mr. Kotaro, this is a bit sudden,

00:05:54.167 --> 00:05:55.918
but can I take a photo
with you over there?

00:05:56.002 --> 00:05:56.836
Sure.

00:05:56.919 --> 00:05:57.837
Thank you.

00:06:01.632 --> 00:06:05.386
Rinrin is amazing. She knows that
the first move is crucial in romance.

00:06:05.469 --> 00:06:08.639
Right. We can't match her.

00:06:08.723 --> 00:06:09.765
-Mr. Ryusei.
-What?

00:06:10.725 --> 00:06:13.477
Care to share some wine
with me over there?

00:06:13.561 --> 00:06:14.770
Seriously?

00:06:14.854 --> 00:06:16.189
Sounds good.

00:06:17.231 --> 00:06:18.232
Midori.

00:06:18.316 --> 00:06:21.152
Romance is a survival game.

00:06:21.944 --> 00:06:24.488
Were you always
this motivated about romance?

00:06:39.545 --> 00:06:42.590
What do you do at your IT company?

00:06:42.673 --> 00:06:44.425
I'm the CD for our product branch.

00:06:44.508 --> 00:06:46.052
CD?

00:06:46.135 --> 00:06:48.888
Do you mean a CD for listening to music?

00:06:48.971 --> 00:06:49.972
Oh, wow!

00:06:50.056 --> 00:06:51.724
She's doing the quirky ditz act!

00:06:51.807 --> 00:06:54.852
No, that's not it.
It stands for "creative director."

00:06:54.936 --> 00:06:57.063
Wow! Creative?

00:06:57.146 --> 00:06:59.732
Your job must take a lot of talent!

00:06:59.815 --> 00:07:03.402
I'm lucky my tastes are so well-received.

00:07:03.486 --> 00:07:04.362
It's just luck.

00:07:04.445 --> 00:07:08.032
-No, you're talented.
-Not at all.

00:07:08.115 --> 00:07:10.952
The popular girls' staple lines…

00:07:11.035 --> 00:07:13.287
She's making full use of them!

00:07:13.371 --> 00:07:17.416
By the way, you look pretty well-built.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.960
-You noticed?
-Yes.

00:07:19.043 --> 00:07:21.087
Actually, I hit the gym four times a week.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.382
Amazing! Do you also
pay close attention to your diet?

00:07:24.465 --> 00:07:25.341
I do.

00:07:25.424 --> 00:07:28.928
My diet basically revolves around
protein and lean meats.

00:07:29.011 --> 00:07:31.305
I'm also quite health-conscious.

00:07:31.389 --> 00:07:34.475
Lately, I even got
a food advisor certificate!

00:07:34.559 --> 00:07:36.143
-Oh, really?
-Liar!

00:07:36.227 --> 00:07:38.729
You just saw that on Last Princess!

00:07:38.813 --> 00:07:40.147
I can make any dish!

00:07:40.231 --> 00:07:42.900
You're a financial planner, right?

00:07:42.984 --> 00:07:47.238
Yes. If you're interested,
I can help you with your life planning.

00:07:47.321 --> 00:07:48.781
Thank you.

00:07:48.864 --> 00:07:53.369
Then, in return,
I'll help you with your life planning.

00:07:53.452 --> 00:07:56.163
What? Are you also a licensed FP?

00:07:56.247 --> 00:07:58.082
No, I'm not certified, but…

00:07:58.165 --> 00:08:00.668
I can see the future.

00:08:00.751 --> 00:08:02.878
She's going for the eccentric act!

00:08:02.962 --> 00:08:04.880
Can you explain?

00:08:04.964 --> 00:08:06.424
I love fortune-telling.

00:08:06.507 --> 00:08:09.760
I do tarot, and I can also read palms.

00:08:09.844 --> 00:08:11.220
I see!

00:08:11.304 --> 00:08:12.972
Let me borrow your right hand.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:16.892
Casual physical contact…

00:08:16.976 --> 00:08:20.688
Tsumugi, you are also
quite experienced in this, huh?

00:08:20.771 --> 00:08:25.067
I've heard celebrities and successful
people often have a "charisma line."

00:08:25.151 --> 00:08:26.569
Do I have it?

00:08:26.652 --> 00:08:31.240
No, it doesn't look like
you have a charisma line.

00:08:31.824 --> 00:08:34.452
However, your life line
is incredibly long.

00:08:35.161 --> 00:08:38.873
Oh, and your head line is quite short.

00:08:38.956 --> 00:08:39.957
Short?

00:08:40.041 --> 00:08:41.167
Wait, do you even have it?

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.126
Maybe you don't.

00:08:42.209 --> 00:08:44.879
-Can you cook anything?
-Oh, that's not it.

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:48.799
What kind of work do you do?

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:50.384
Oh.

00:08:51.302 --> 00:08:54.138
I am not working right now.

00:08:54.221 --> 00:08:56.349
A lot happened.

00:08:56.432 --> 00:09:00.478
You're Mr. Konta's younger sister, right?

00:09:00.561 --> 00:09:01.395
Yes.

00:09:01.479 --> 00:09:03.856
I see! That explains it!

00:09:03.939 --> 00:09:06.025
What? No, that's not it!

00:09:06.108 --> 00:09:09.403
You see, unlike my brother,
I actually care about my future.

00:09:09.487 --> 00:09:11.280
-It's okay, I understand.
-What?

00:09:11.364 --> 00:09:13.449
-I'm the same way.
-What?

00:09:14.158 --> 00:09:16.827
What kind of business
are you preparing to launch?

00:09:16.911 --> 00:09:18.996
B-Business?

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:21.707
Well, I'm not sure about business.

00:09:21.791 --> 00:09:25.044
In fact, I'm not even sure
what I want to do yet.

00:09:25.127 --> 00:09:26.462
-Ms. Midori!
-What?

00:09:26.545 --> 00:09:28.214
That is a dangerous way of thinking.

00:09:28.297 --> 00:09:29.131
What?

00:09:29.215 --> 00:09:33.469
If you think of business in terms of
what you want to do, you will fail!

00:09:34.136 --> 00:09:34.970
No, but…

00:09:35.638 --> 00:09:37.139
I don't plan to start a business.

00:09:37.223 --> 00:09:38.140
What?

00:09:41.227 --> 00:09:43.187
Oh, well…

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.731
How do I start, then?

00:09:45.815 --> 00:09:47.233
First is surveying.

00:09:47.316 --> 00:09:50.945
You survey various people
to identify insights before you set up.

00:09:51.028 --> 00:09:54.031
There are so many entrepreneurs
who don't understand this.

00:09:54.115 --> 00:09:55.866
That's why everyone fails.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:59.954
I see. You're amazing, Mr. Norito.

00:10:00.037 --> 00:10:01.997
Oh, if you would like,

00:10:02.081 --> 00:10:05.251
I have a members-only service
where I post all about entrepreneurship.

00:10:05.334 --> 00:10:07.253
Would you like to subscribe to my service?

00:10:07.336 --> 00:10:08.254
A subscription?

00:10:08.337 --> 00:10:12.717
Yes! You can learn business know-how
for just 550 yen a month.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:13.718
It's a great deal.

00:10:18.389 --> 00:10:19.348
Subscribe?

00:10:19.432 --> 00:10:21.517
No, I won't.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:24.270
I can't afford
to be wasting money right now.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:28.190
I was thinking when I eventually
get married and have a family,

00:10:28.274 --> 00:10:30.192
for the sake of my children,

00:10:30.276 --> 00:10:34.238
I should acquire some knowledge
about food and cooking, starting now.

00:10:34.321 --> 00:10:37.241
Wait, am I getting ahead of myself?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.418
I'm sorry, did I talk too much?

00:10:49.044 --> 00:10:52.131
No, it's just… too dazzling.

00:10:53.174 --> 00:10:54.258
Oh, my…

00:10:55.593 --> 00:10:56.844
I mean the sunlight.

00:10:57.386 --> 00:10:58.345
What?

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.599
I really don't want to get a sunburn.

00:11:01.682 --> 00:11:03.267
Could we swap seats?

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:05.186
Actually, should we just head inside?

00:11:06.437 --> 00:11:07.772
Should we do that?

00:11:07.855 --> 00:11:09.565
-Let's go inside.
-Yeah.

00:11:09.648 --> 00:11:11.650
If you hate UV rays that much,

00:11:11.734 --> 00:11:14.862
you should have worn sunscreen
before coming!

00:11:16.197 --> 00:11:18.741
This painting
must be really expensive too.

00:11:18.824 --> 00:11:19.992
That's true.

00:11:20.075 --> 00:11:21.118
It's amazing, right?

00:11:21.202 --> 00:11:22.912
Yes, it has a deep flavor.

00:11:22.995 --> 00:11:24.914
A deep flavor?

00:11:24.997 --> 00:11:26.457
All right!

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:27.833
So heavy.

00:11:28.501 --> 00:11:30.127
I'm back!

00:11:32.671 --> 00:11:34.423
-Are you a guest?
-Right.

00:11:34.507 --> 00:11:35.549
He's our servant.

00:11:35.633 --> 00:11:36.634
I see.

00:11:36.717 --> 00:11:37.635
Nice to meet you.

00:11:37.718 --> 00:11:39.303
Oh, hello.

00:11:42.473 --> 00:11:44.099
Amazing.

00:11:54.151 --> 00:11:55.569
What would you like to drink next?

00:11:57.154 --> 00:11:58.697
I'm not sure…

00:11:59.907 --> 00:12:00.950
Hey.

00:12:01.951 --> 00:12:03.327
Do you have red? Red?

00:12:04.036 --> 00:12:04.870
Red?

00:12:04.954 --> 00:12:06.497
I mean red wine.

00:12:07.373 --> 00:12:10.459
-Oh, red!
-Red wine. Yes, please.

00:12:11.544 --> 00:12:13.045
Red…

00:12:13.128 --> 00:12:15.256
-Oh, red!
-It's beautiful.

00:12:16.507 --> 00:12:19.468
-It's a great size.
-That's right.

00:12:19.552 --> 00:12:20.427
Red.

00:12:20.511 --> 00:12:23.681
-The walls are pretty too.
-Yes, they are.

00:12:23.764 --> 00:12:25.599
-They go well together.
-Yes.

00:12:28.978 --> 00:12:29.812
Red!

00:12:30.729 --> 00:12:31.897
Wait, no.

00:12:31.981 --> 00:12:32.898
That's a lot.

00:12:34.066 --> 00:12:35.401
Oh, wow.

00:12:36.068 --> 00:12:37.278
Well then!

00:12:37.361 --> 00:12:39.196
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

00:12:42.449 --> 00:12:44.034
This color…

00:12:44.118 --> 00:12:46.620
I wonder if it's a Pinot Noir
from Burgundy.

00:12:56.797 --> 00:12:58.048
Cherry…

00:12:58.132 --> 00:13:00.175
Raspberry… It's so fruity.

00:13:00.259 --> 00:13:01.302
RED WINE FOR COOKING USE

00:13:03.012 --> 00:13:05.097
But the mouthfeel is soft.

00:13:06.015 --> 00:13:08.225
SUPER CHEAP RED WINE FOR COOKING USE

00:13:08.309 --> 00:13:10.352
Hey, this isn't bad.

00:13:10.436 --> 00:13:13.939
I think if you decant it a bit more,
the aroma will open up even further.

00:13:15.149 --> 00:13:16.025
Decant?

00:13:16.108 --> 00:13:17.401
Decant. This.

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:20.404
Decant?

00:13:22.865 --> 00:13:24.658
-Decant.
-Decant!

00:13:24.742 --> 00:13:28.704
That wine is a cooking wine
I bought from a nearby supermarket.

00:13:28.787 --> 00:13:30.664
A 780-yen wine.

00:13:32.374 --> 00:13:34.460
Was there anyone you liked?

00:13:34.543 --> 00:13:39.673
Let's see… How should I put it?
It's not that they're bad people…

00:13:39.757 --> 00:13:40.966
I get it.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.802
It's like…

00:13:43.886 --> 00:13:47.264
They are completely empty inside.

00:13:47.348 --> 00:13:48.599
Exactly.

00:13:49.516 --> 00:13:53.896
They sound smart when they talk,
but they feel weirdly shallow.

00:13:53.979 --> 00:13:56.273
It seems they were classmates in college.

00:13:56.357 --> 00:13:57.858
He gave me his socials.

00:13:58.984 --> 00:13:59.860
Wow!

00:13:59.943 --> 00:14:02.279
It feels like a seminar channel!

00:14:03.364 --> 00:14:06.367
Well, it's not like
they're bad people, right?

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:08.494
I'm going to stick it out a little longer!

00:14:08.577 --> 00:14:09.953
I've had enough.

00:14:10.037 --> 00:14:12.373
Seminar guys
are not romantic options for me.

00:14:12.456 --> 00:14:13.290
True.

00:14:13.374 --> 00:14:15.417
When I talked to him,
he was all business talk.

00:14:15.501 --> 00:14:16.585
What is up with that?

00:14:23.634 --> 00:14:25.594
Would you like a refill?

00:14:25.678 --> 00:14:26.804
Thank you.

00:14:28.514 --> 00:14:31.809
By the way, do you all have girlfriends?

00:14:31.892 --> 00:14:33.185
No, I don't.

00:14:33.268 --> 00:14:34.645
-Me neither.
-Same here.

00:14:34.728 --> 00:14:37.356
Oh! I thought girls
would be all over you guys!

00:14:37.439 --> 00:14:38.607
No way.

00:14:38.691 --> 00:14:41.944
I guess work is my girlfriend right now.

00:14:42.528 --> 00:14:45.072
My marriage phase
is quite far in the future.

00:14:46.824 --> 00:14:49.535
Hey, will Mr. Konta be back soon?

00:14:49.618 --> 00:14:51.620
I got a message from him earlier.

00:14:51.704 --> 00:14:53.205
He said he'll be here any minute.

00:14:53.288 --> 00:14:55.124
I see! Great!

00:14:55.207 --> 00:14:58.168
We came here
because we wanted to talk to him!

00:14:58.252 --> 00:14:59.128
What?

00:14:59.211 --> 00:15:02.840
Mr. Konta, the millionaire
who got to retire at a young age.

00:15:04.842 --> 00:15:05.926
Say what?

00:15:25.571 --> 00:15:27.197
What made you so interested in me?

00:15:27.281 --> 00:15:29.199
I knew you were someone extraordinary!

00:15:29.283 --> 00:15:32.077
Please teach us the secret
to your success, Mr. Konta.

00:15:32.161 --> 00:15:33.829
How you became a millionaire
at a young age!

00:15:33.912 --> 00:15:36.081
The three of us
actually post videos online.

00:15:36.165 --> 00:15:38.542
Would you consider appearing in one?

00:15:38.625 --> 00:15:39.585
Cheers!

00:15:39.668 --> 00:15:40.669
No! The meat!

00:15:42.171 --> 00:15:46.341
Today, I think I finally figured out
who I should really be looking at.

00:15:46.425 --> 00:15:47.801
Would you be willing to invest in us?

00:15:47.885 --> 00:15:48.802
1,000.

00:15:48.886 --> 00:15:49.762
Sure.

00:15:49.845 --> 00:15:50.804
Mr. Nishigami!

00:15:50.888 --> 00:15:53.474
I am… Mr. Nishigami…

00:15:58.687 --> 00:15:59.730
What?

00:16:00.647 --> 00:16:01.607
Subtitle translation by: Nix S.